<!--
  v56 — status-bar (small) notification icon for ComputerCaller.

  Android renders the SMALL notification icon as an alpha mask: every
  non-transparent pixel is repainted with the system's own tint. A
  gradient or multi-colour asset therefore collapses into a solid blob,
  which is why the brand mark's rounded-square plate is NOT used here.

  This is the alpha-only silhouette of the handset from
  design/extension-marks/mark-mini.svg, re-centred in a 24dp canvas.
  PLACEHOLDER — Pixel may refine the stroke weights in v56 step 2;
  the resource NAME is the contract and must not change.
-->
